---
import SectionHeading from "./SectionHeading.astro";
---

<section id="about" class="section">
  <SectionHeading eyebrow="A little about me" title="Engineer by practice. Curious by default." />
  <div class="about-layout">
    <img class="about-image" src="/assets/picture3.jpeg" alt="Rupanjana smiling outdoors" loading="lazy" />
    <div class="about-content">
      <p class="about-lead">I care about the space where solid engineering meets a genuinely good user experience.</p>
      <div class="stat-grid">
        <article>
          <span>Current Role</span>
          <strong>System Engineer</strong>
          <p>Tata Consultancy Services</p>
        </article>
        <article>
          <span>Education</span>
          <strong>B.Tech CSE</strong>
          <p>VIT Vellore</p>
        </article>
      </div>
      <p>
        I’m a Computer Science graduate from VIT Vellore who enjoys the full build loop: shaping an interface, connecting dependable APIs, tracing edge cases, and refining the details that make a product feel complete.
      </p>
      <p>
        I’ve worked on hospital management workflows, ETL pipelines, responsive components, and LLM explainability projects, while also coordinating large-scale technical events. Basically, I like code with purpose, teams with energy, and products that do more than just look good.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
